      "versionNonce": 8196149,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Cost is EGRESS, and it is linear in the audience:  500 attendees x ~800 kbps = ~430 Mbps.\nAttendees publish nothing, so inbound is only the presenters.",
      "originalText": "Cost is EGRESS, and it is linear in the audience:  500 attendees x ~800 kbps = ~430 Mbps.\nAttendees publish nothing, so inbound is only the presenters.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "text-72-8855",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 754.0,
      "height": 48.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1477498383,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 364120812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Automatic quality: judge() in lib/network.ts samples loss, RTT and available bandwidth every 2 s\nand steps the publisher full -> reduced -> minimal. RTT is judged as EXCESS OVER THIS ROUTE'S FLOOR,\nnever absolutely - an absolute 300 ms threshold made a 280 ms route degrade and never recover.",
      "originalText": "Automatic quality: judge() in lib/network.ts samples loss, RTT and available bandwidth every 2 s\nand steps the publisher full -> reduced -> minimal. RTT is judged as EXCESS OVER THIS ROUTE'S FLOOR,\nnever absolutely - an absolute 300 ms threshold made a 280 ms route degrade and never recover.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
